# This Dockerfile has no COPY, so the context is only ever uploaded and thrown
# away. Keep run artefacts out of it anyway: /work is bind-mounted at run time
# and artifacts/ fills with logs, maps and generated worlds, and shipping them
# to the daemon on every rebuild is pure cost.
# NOTE dockerignore semantics differ from git: patterns are root-anchored
# filepath.Match globs, so directories are named explicitly.
artifacts/
logs/
.git/
**/__pycache__
.*.swp
